ECDSAValidator::onInstall
├── given valid init data (a non-zero signer)
│   └── when installed by the account
│       └── it should store the signer keyed by the account (signerOf)
├── given the zero address as signer
│   └── when installed
│       └── it should revert with InvalidSigner
└── given the credential was set then uninstalled
    └── when onUninstall is called
        └── it should clear the signer (signerOf == 0)
